.TH heliosctl-wifi-set 1 0.1.0 "heliosctl 0.1.0" "Helios Manual"
.SH NAME
heliosctl\-wifi\-set \- Add a network, or change one: the device applies it before this returns
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBheliosctl wifi set\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-endpoint\fR] [\fB\-\-passphrase\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-open\fR] [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-\-hidden\fR] [\fB\-\-region\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-ssid\fR> <\fIDEVICE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a network, or change one: the device applies it before this returns
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON document on stdout, and errors as JSON on stderr
.TP
\fB\-\-ssid\fR \fI<SSID>\fR
The network\*(Aqs name (SSID), at most 32 bytes
.TP
\fB\-\-endpoint\fR \fI<ENDPOINT>\fR
The Control API\*(Aqs base URL (…/dev)
.TP
\fB\-\-passphrase\-file\fR \fI<PASSPHRASE_FILE>\fR
A file holding the WPA2/WPA3\-Personal passphrase, or \- for stdin
.TP
\fB\-\-open\fR
An open network, with no passphrase
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<PROFILE>\fR
The AWS profile: one that assumes helios\-operator [default: helios\-operator]
.TP
\fB\-\-hidden\fR
The network doesn\*(Aqt broadcast its SSID
.TP
\fB\-\-region\fR \fI<REGION>\fR
The AWS region [default: the profile\*(Aqs]
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Check the input and print the request (passphrase hidden) without sending it
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIDEVICE\fR>
A device ID (d\-…) or thing name (t\-…)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBheliosctl\fR(1), for exit status, environment, files and security.
